WEBVTT

00:00:05.784 --> 00:00:11.784
Choose Audit log in the side menu.

00:00:13.093 --> 00:00:18.352
Scroll to Result.

00:00:18.602 --> 00:00:24.602
Type "video." in the Action box.

00:00:25.654 --> 00:00:30.915
Click Filter.

00:00:31.165 --> 00:00:37.165
Click Open details for video.publish
at 10 Mar, 7:36 to open the entry.

00:00:43.183 --> 00:00:49.183
Scroll to Before.

00:00:49.696 --> 00:00:54.956
Click Close.

00:00:55.206 --> 00:01:00.466
Click Clear.
